    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area Approx. 90 sqm / 969 sqft\n\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present 181 Ratoath Road, Cabra, Dublin 7 to the market. A spacious four bedroom, two bathroom home offering well proportioned accommodation. \n\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming living room to the front of the property, providing a comfortable space for relaxing and entertaining, along with a separate study room, ideal for working from home or flexible use. The kitchen is well equipped with an integrated oven, electric hob and extractor fan.\n\nThe property boasts four bedrooms and two bathrooms. Bedroom 3 benefits from double doors leading out to a private courtyard, while Bedroom 4 features doors providing direct access to the rear garden, offering excellent flexibility and an abundance of natural light. All rooms throughout the property benefit from laminate wood flooring and recessed lighting, creating a modern and cohesive finish.\n\nExternally, the property is particularly appealing, with a front garden providing off-street parking for two cars. To the rear is a long and spacious east-facing garden, offering generous outdoor space while enjoying the morning and daytime sunshine.\nSituated on Ratoath Road, the property is close to a wide range of local amenities, schools, shops and public transport links, with Dublin City Centre easily accessible.\n\nViewing is highly recommended\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 2.85m (9'4\") x 1.76m (5'9\")\nComposite hall door, laminate wood floor, under stair storage & recessed lighting.\n\nLiving Room - 2.87m (9'5\") x 2.68m (8'10\")\nWith laminate wood floor & recessed lighting.\n\nKitchen - 3.38m (11'1\") x 4.81m (15'9\")\nwith a range of modern floor & eye level fitted press units, tiled splashback. Integrated oven, electric hob & extractor fan. PVC door to outside courtyard\n\nBathroom - 2.22m (7'3\") x 1.59m (5'3\")\nFully tiled walls and floor, with w.c., w.h.b., shower & vanity unit. Heated towel rail\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.64m (15'3\") x 3.23m (10'7\")\nto front of house with laminate wood floor.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3m (9'10\") x 2.83m (9'3\")\nto rear of house with laminate wood floor.\n\nUpstairs Bathroom - 1.88m (6'2\") x 1.54m (5'1\")\nFully tiled walls and floor, with w.c., w.h.b. shower & Heated towel rail.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.69m (12'1\") x 2.1m (6'11\")\nwith laminate wood floor, recessed lighting & PVC double doors leading to outdoor courtyard.\n\nBedroom 4 - 3.69m (12'1\") x 3.56m (11'8\")\nwith laminate wood floor coverings and recessed lighting.\n\nStudy - 2.86m (9'5\") x 2.2m (7'3\")\nwith laminate wood floor coverings and recessed lighting.\n\n"
      },
      {
